  "details": "1. VRChat doesn't see any audio on the mic device, while the windows system sees it.\n\n2. Disabling / Enabling audio devices (or switching their state in any) causes to lose the devices at all, listing nothing.\n\n3. After restarting VRChat it changes state from 2 to 1, but still doesn't work. System restart doesn't help either. \n\nSee video: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1j60ymeltqo9j1eVcKFenAb1BIBKnkHyk/view?usp=sharing (no sound recorded in the video, only visuals)\n\nNot attaching the log into public.\n\n- All other software and games on the system accept mic and receive audio normally.\n\n- Issue seems to be happening after latest Steam-only update, everything was ok a day ago.\n\n- Experienced this bug few years ago but now it's back, as I can see.",
